 "coaching_points": [
  "Warm up 2-3 minutes \u2014 light jog, leg swings, easy weak-foot rolls and side-foot passes before striking at pace",
  "One ball: after every strike jog in to collect it from the goal and dribble back out wide to the start \u2014 that jog is your rest",
  "Weak foot only \u2014 a strong-foot strike counts as a miss, no exceptions",
  "The prep touch is the cut \u2014 dribble to the approach cone, then sharply cut across your body to the touch cone so the ball sits in your weak-foot zone; never strike from on top of the approach cone",
  "Glance up at the corner gate between the cut and the strike; plant foot beside the ball, head still at contact",
  "Target: 6 of 10 strikes through a corner gate within 2 seconds of the cut \u2014 count out loud; alternate near-post and far-post gates",
  "Lock the ankle and keep the knee of the striking leg over the ball to drive it low and protect the joint",
  "10 strikes per set, 4 sets; collecting the ball is the rest between reps",
  "Hit 8/10 \u2192 step 3m further out; miss 5 \u2192 widen the gate to make contact clean first"
 ],
 "variations": [
  "Both approach angles \u2014 alternate the wide-right and wide-left start every rep",
  "One-touch finish \u2014 cut and strike in a single motion, no settle touch",
  "Full version needs a server feeding your back-to-goal for the quick-turn finish; add a partner when you have one"
 ],
